# Names that must never appear in this repository: private deployments, their
# agents, their tools, their domains. One extended-regex pattern per line,
# matched case-insensitively. `#` starts a comment.
#
# Copy to `.private-names` (git-ignored) and put the real names there. The
# real list does not belong in a public repository — a blocklist that names
# what it hides publishes it.
acme-corp
acme\.example
widget_count
